  "_doc": [
    "Skill / quest / membership requirements for OSRS items and objects.",
    "Names are matched case-insensitively against the in-game name.",
    "Tiered metal weapons and armor (Bronze, Iron, Steel, Black, Mithril,",
    "Adamant, Rune, Dragon) are computed by formula in code — only items",
    "that DEVIATE from tier (quest-locked, special, members-only) need an",
    "explicit entry here.",
    "",
    "Schema:",
    "  skills : [['SkillCode', level], ...]   short codes — Atk Str Def Rng Mag Pray HP WC Mine Fish Cook FM Craft Smith Fletch Slay Farm Con Hunt Agi Thiev Herb RC",
